  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A block of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.50\\text{ kg}\"></span> is moving at a velocity of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"+2.0\\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span> on a frictionless horizontal surface. It collides with a second block of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.50\\text{ kg}\"></span> which is initially at rest. The table provides data for the velocities of the blocks before and after the collision.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Block</th><th>Mass / kg</th><th>Velocity before collision / <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\text{m s}^{-1}\"></span></th><th>Velocity after collision / <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\text{m s}^{-1}\"></span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>0.50</td><td>+2.0</td><td>-1.0</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>1.50</td><td>0.0</td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What is the velocity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> of the <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.50\\text{ kg}\"></span> block immediately after the collision?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"+0.33\\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"+0.67\\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"+1.0\\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"+2.0\\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
